{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three men, Alpha, Beta, and Gamma, working together, do a job in 6 hours less time than Alpha alone, in 1 hour less time than Beta alone, and in one-half the time needed by Gamma when working alone. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be the number of hours needed by Alpha and Beta, working together, to do the job. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/440ccdc54fd28348182022c9f18c06de89b21a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{5}{2} \\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{3}{2} \\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{4}{3} \\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{5}{4} \\quad \\text{(E) } \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"282\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> denote the number of hours needed by Alpha, Beta, Gamma, respectively. We also have their respective efficiency <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/7/3d7ee97438a98f178626c804d334bfcdbd7bef80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"16\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/6/e867e03a47b367b8dc4feea0a9bda193d35a49b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"17\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f9c3cf3b7c170e9eb7fee524a4efef99e46953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"16\" height=\"37\" />. Thus we get the equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/6/e26c40b89eeabe776619cbb25ba5c46c570e35b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{A}+\\frac{1}{B}+\\frac{1}{C}=\\frac{1}{A-6}\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3c35188ae70a4151610aa17bef358284e15aa27.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{A}+\\frac{1}{B}+\\frac{1}{C}=\\frac{1}{B-1}\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/5/5f5070052534001d5d3275be6187807bde3f2227.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{A}+\\frac{1}{B}+\\frac{1}{C}=\\frac{2}{C}\\Longrightarrow \\frac{1}{A}+\\frac{1}{B}=\\frac{1}{C}\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"37\" />\nEquating the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equations gets \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba769ed48f103ed1747abefcb0fb51a0ac26929.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{A-6}=\\frac{1}{B-1}\\Longrightarrow A=B+5\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"37\" />\nSubstituting the new relation along with the third equation into the first equation gets\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d8542d0e43ec1c29da6109de68f6bd013ed73f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{A}+\\frac{2}{A-5}=\\frac{1}{A-6}\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"37\" />\nSolving the quadratic gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a73e337d455df9943a5fcd2af1514061aa060ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/c/52c8748f312ef1225fa2cab8d5a39d8e19de34d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{20}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/47689b83ae8aab327d56803f3f8be890201c93e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=A-5&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"116\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd48b4dc4afd1c9efdaf1a1ecda73782a8892d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\frac{20}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> is the only legit solution.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e34efd80f24e7e17bb871742cfd1a1c96a44f439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=\\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"54\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/271f64c93ba09a9c27ce9d19cd10786320d43da8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h=\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{A}+\\frac{1}{B}}=\\frac{4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"125\" height=\"43\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7bfdbb5e480fd502f53b019a98dbc31f2069ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 A